{"title":"1999 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 23","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_CosineMethod_[🔥Fast_and_Easy🔥]\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by CosineMethod [🔥Fast and Easy🔥]</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Square <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> has sides of length 3. Segments <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/3/fa38fd42cdaa5db0dd4e0f7df98ae79a598eb627.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CM$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"36\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/3/ba369b33271c6fb52789f86292cc68559a2e0411.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CN$\" width=\"31\" height=\"12\" /> divide the square's area into three equal parts. How long is segment <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/3/fa38fd42cdaa5db0dd4e0f7df98ae79a598eb627.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CM$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"36\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/b/f6b58b49cd954ac4a1cafb41013acb3af953f570.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] pair A,B,C,D,M,N; A = (0,0); B = (0,3); C = (3,3); D = (3,0); M = (0,1); N = (1,0); draw(A--B--C--D--cycle); draw(M--C--N); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,SW); label(&quot;$M$&quot;,M,W); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,NW); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,NE); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,D,SE); label(&quot;$N$&quot;,N,S); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"242\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/4/834f43d339e407e29780184538e68a82bc09ed8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\sqrt{10} \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ \\sqrt{12} \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ \\sqrt{13} \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ \\sqrt{14} \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\sqrt{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"452\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the square has side length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the area of the entire square is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>The segments divide the square into 3 equal parts, so the area of each part is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/3/a4385ba297c5d00810a27346039d82dd405f5e03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 \\div 3 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/a/03ad6367e9712b0fa31eb8a6b81bcec2405a6320.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle CBM$\" width=\"64\" height=\"13\" /> has area <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/0/48077ce13b97db1623c31ad6d22d54bb4592856b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CB = 3$\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" />, using the area formula for a triangle:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/c/bdccd2beee5b0af408c13c6c1b3773fd9ca76204.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_{tri} = \\frac{1}{2}bh$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"86\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/3/2230652b7008d79b61126899f781808906d21da6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 = \\frac{1}{2}3h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"65\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/2/4824e3f6b13b848b2f6afe5f5df2bb90fa6ef566.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h = 2$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>Thus, height <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/2/1f2ba97323062fd54b92f255a739ac4ac0adb7ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BM = 2$\" width=\"67\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/a/03ad6367e9712b0fa31eb8a6b81bcec2405a6320.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle CBM$\" width=\"64\" height=\"13\" /> is a right triangle, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/0/430cbd2e28a0831299f801511f12aec9bbf189c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CM = \\sqrt{BM^2 + BC^2} = \\sqrt{2^2 + 3^2} = \\boxed{\\text{(C)}\\ \\sqrt{13}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"368\" height=\"33\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Connect <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/8/4e8a79d5db79cbfaa2e6fea9933915bbb03b6621.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_\\triangle AMC=S_\\triangle ANC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"166\" height=\"19\" />. To satisfied the three area is equal, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/9/9b9bb59254d6a4565a2670458655e0311539a706.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2S_\\triangle AMC=S_\\triangle BMC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"179\" height=\"19\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/d/57d80c39be8dd5c0ae7df0d5b0f35f3e531fa7c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2S_\\triangle ANC=S_\\triangle DNC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"174\" height=\"19\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/7/a078a658ad407ba888ad4cf386db60bcd86ff0bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AM=AN=\\frac{1}{2}BM=\\frac{1}{2}ND=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"264\" height=\"38\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/d/2cd25723bb2f785b83c700f3cfc8aca744733eec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BM=2,BC=3,MC=\\boxed{\\text{(C)}\\ \\sqrt{13}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"281\" height=\"35\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_CosineMethod_.5B.F0.9F.94.A5Fast_and_Easy.F0.9F.94.A5.5D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_CosineMethod_[🔥Fast_and_Easy🔥]\">Video Solution by CosineMethod [🔥Fast and Easy🔥]</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by CosineMethod [🔥Fast and Easy🔥]\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AH5_Gol2GCM\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AH5_Gol2GCM</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8\" title=\"1999 AMC 8\">1999 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"1999 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"1999 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1999\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1999 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?tit